Kazuha Hub Wi-Fi RADIUS for OPNsense is a site's RADIUS proxy for the
WPA2/WPA3-Enterprise Wi-Fi. It terminates EAP-TTLS from the access points with a
server certificate from the OPNsense trust store and forwards the tunneled PAP
request to the central RADIUS servers, in a fail-over order, over a shared
secret. It runs the FreeRADIUS daemon of the freeradius3 package with its own
configuration directory, listens on the static IPv4 address of the selected local
interfaces only and never on the WAN, and cannot be installed next to
os-freeradius.
